graph TD
    Start([Start Export: GET /adventures/{id}/export]) --> CollectData[Fetch Template, Scenes, NPCs,<br/>Objects, Switches, Exits, Quests & Awards]
    CollectData --> BuildManifest[Assemble WorldManifesto JSON<br/>(Version 1.3 Format)]
    
    BuildManifest --> FormatCheck{Export Format?}
    
    FormatCheck -->|.adv| DownloadJSON[Return JSON Response (.adv)]
    FormatCheck -->|.adz| PackageZIP[Prepare ZIP Archive (.adz)]
    
    subgraph ZIP_Packaging [Archive Packaging]
        direction TB
        AddManifest[Add adventure.adv to Root] --> IdentifyAssets[Identify Referenced /data/... Visuals]
        IdentifyAssets --> CopyAssets[Bundle local images into /assets/ directory]
        CopyAssets --> RewritePaths[Rewrite image URLs to relative assets/... paths]
    end
    
    PackageZIP --> ZIP_Packaging
    ZIP_Packaging --> DownloadZIP[Return ZIP Binary Stream (.adz)]
    
    DownloadJSON --> End([Export Complete])
    DownloadZIP --> End
